20,521, with 1,153 excess predictions and 3,094 misses. Pooled F1 values are 0.898
and 0.906, respectively, at intersection over union ≥ 0.5. The original
independent-author sheet and its source record retain this comparison;
annotation-empty fields coincide at the scatter origin.

Original artwork retains wider context and source records: process architecture,
runtime composition, compiler preparation, typed extension, full-plate
translocation, translocation development, H001 scored review, volume repair,
orthogonal localisation, retinal review, retinal development, paired DNA repair,
actin support checks, public shaft/junction review and public main shafts. Retinal
source: user-provided R0010 RBPMS images; physical calibration unverified.
DNA/actin source: BBBC007v1 A02, Sabatini laboratory, Whitehead Institute; CC0.

